# Raw crash-report dumps contain unrelated DEVICE telemetry -- SiriSearchFeedback,
# DifferentialPrivacy, Analytics-*, log-aggregated and friends are the operator's
# personal device data, not evidence for this investigation, and they do not
# belong in the repo.
#
# What IS evidence: reports attributable to OUR app, plus the NEW-since-arm
# listings the harness writes (those live outside these directories, so they are
# not matched here).
#
# The `**/` prefix is load-bearing: a pattern containing a slash is anchored to
# THIS file's directory, so `crashreports_*/*` would only match a run folder
# literally named crashreports_* beside this file -- and every dump would sail
# straight into the commit, which is exactly what happened the first time.
**/crashreports_*/**
!**/crashreports_*/Runner*
!**/crashreports_*/Jetsam*
!**/crashreports_*/*irstActivation*

# RAW syslog is NEVER committed.
#
# `idevicesyslog` unfiltered captures EVERYTHING the phone logs -- every app, every
# daemon, network and account activity -- so it is the operator's personal device
# data, not evidence for this investigation. It is also enormous: one armed run
# accumulated 546,528 lines / 80 MB in under an hour, and it was committed and
# pushed to a PUBLIC fork before this rule existed.
#
# The filtered `syslog.log` that `collect` derives IS the evidence, and it is kept.
**/syslog_raw.log

# CONTAINER PULLS: drop the non-evidence subtrees explicitly.
#
# `ios-deploy --download` retrieves the WHOLE app container, so a naive add swept
# in Library/Caches, SplashBoard launch snapshots (.ktx images of the app's
# screen) and Saved Application State. None of it is evidence.
#
# EXCLUDED BY SUBTREE, not by excluding the container and re-including the good
# parts: git cannot re-include a path whose parent directory is excluded, so the
# `!` form was silently inert and 294 junk files stayed staged.
**/pre_state/Library/Caches/**
**/post_state/Library/Caches/**
**/pre_state/Library/SplashBoard/**
**/post_state/Library/SplashBoard/**
**/pre_state/Library/Saved Application State/**
**/post_state/Library/Saved Application State/**
**/pre_state/Library/Preferences/**
**/post_state/Library/Preferences/**
**/pre_state/tmp/**
**/post_state/tmp/**
